# {{ project_name }}

This reveal.js presentation uses the
[`fs-ise-presentation`](https://github.com/fs-ise/quarto-template-presentation)
Quarto extension.

## Work on the presentation

```bash
quarto preview presentation.qmd
```

Render the project with:

```bash
quarto render
```

The rendered site is written to `_site/`.

## Update dependencies

Update the presentation extension independently of this project's files:

```bash
quarto update extension fs-ise/quarto-template-presentation
```

Update the Copier-managed scaffolding from the project directory:

```bash
copier update --trust
```

`presentation.qmd` is intentionally protected from Copier updates, so your
slides remain yours. Copier records the template version and your answers in
`.copier-answers.yml`; commit that file so future updates can reproduce the
project.
